
 Integrating Your CashApp Cashtag ($Sephraines)

To route player payments and token purchase fund donations directly to your personal CashApp, you can deploy a Direct CashTag Deep-Linking Matrix.
When a user opens the Divine Marketplace to purchase upgrades or send donations to support the site, the interface generates a dynamic payment button. On mobile devices, this button automatically fires an intent link that launches the native CashApp on the user's phone, pre-populating your Cashtag and the chosen donation amount. On desktop browsers, it renders a secure transaction gateway displaying a QR code wrapper pointing straight to your link profile.

